  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071448",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-130285",
      "knowledge_point_id": "0464b51e-8568-521e-96a5-a65c04569c2a",
      "knowledge_point": "Identifying the Appropriate Row Operation To Transform a Given Entry to a Desired Value",
      "problem": "Given \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 2 & 4 \\\\ -9 & 1 & -5 \\\\ 8 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}]$,\nwhich of the following elementary row operations makes ${a}_{32}=0?$",
      "worked_solution": "Of the given options, we consider the row operation \n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1}.\n$$\n\nApplying the above row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}6 & 2 & 4 \\\\ -9 & 1 & -5 \\\\ 8 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2)\\cdot {R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}6 & 2 & 4 \\\\ -9 & 1 & -5 \\\\ -4 & 0 & -8\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the required row operation is\n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1}.\n$$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{R}_{3}:=(-2){R}_{3}",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{R}_{1}↔{R}_{3}",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{R}_{1}↔{R}_{2}",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+4{R}_{2}",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1}",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "provenance": {
        "activity_question": "question-130285",
        "kp_title": "Identifying the Appropriate Row Operation To Transform a Given Entry to a Desired Value",
        "kp_href": null
      },
